* Touchscreen phone: navigate to a conversation, compose a message, and send it.
Goal: Send a message from a touchscreen phone
. Goal: Open messaging application
.. Look at <messaging application>
.. Touch <messaging application>
.. Verify messaging application is open
. Goal: Select conversation
.. Search for <recipient name>
.. Touch <recipient name>
.. Verify conversation with <recipient name> is open
. Goal: Compose message
.. Look at <message field>
.. Touch <message field>
.. Type <message text>
.. Verify <message text> is displayed
. Goal: Send message
.. Look at <send button>
.. Touch <send button>
.. Verify message is sent
